// Direct verification probe for `compiler.pkg.semver` and `compiler.pkg.resolver`
// (T855 / E20.2: SPEC-111 §§1..4 & §6, REQ-ECO-8736, REQ-PKG-022, REQ-PKG-024, REQ-PKG-025, INV-PKG-001).

